{"id":624,"name":"pawniard","speciesId":624,"dex":624,"form":"normal","generation":5,"types":["dark","steel"],"stats":{"hp":45,"attack":85,"defense":70,"special-attack":40,"special-defense":40,"speed":60},"abilities":[{"name":"defiant","hidden":false},{"name":"inner-focus","hidden":false},{"name":"pressure","hidden":true}],"height":5,"weight":102,"baseExp":68,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/624.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/624.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/624.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/624.ogg","genus":"Sharp Blade Pokémon","genusPt":"Pokémon Lâmina Afiada","flavor":[{"version":"black","text":"Blades comprise this Pokémon’s entire body. If battling dulls the blades, it sharpens them on stones by the river."},{"version":"white","text":"They fight at Bisharp’s command. They cling to their prey and inflict damage by sinking their blades into it."},{"version":"black-2","text":"Ignoring their injuries, groups attack by sinking the blades that cover their bodies into their prey."},{"version":"ultra-sun","text":"After shredding its prey, it sharpens its blades on a stone by the river. Each Pawniard has its own favorite sharpening stone."},{"version":"ultra-moon","text":"It follows Bisharp’s orders to a tee when it attacks enemies. After slashing an opponent, Pawniard clangs both of its blades together."},{"version":"sword","text":"It uses river stones to maintain the cutting edges of the blades covering its body. These sharpened blades allow it to bring down opponents."},{"version":"shield","text":"A pack of these Pokémon forms to serve a Bisharp boss. Each Pawniard trains diligently, dreaming of one day taking the lead."}],"flavorPt":"Um pacote desses Pokémon se forma para servir um chefe